# Full-size Google Flow output. These are the raw 16:9 renders that
# tools/install-flow-thumbs.py crops into public/img/menu/ai — 35MB of
# intermediates for 2MB of shipped thumbnails. _state.json lives here too, so
# resuming a batch is a local-machine affair rather than something the repo
# carries.
/tools/flow-out/

